{
  "capitulo": 6,
  "titulo_es": "Lo veo",
  "titulo": { "en": "I see it" },
  "intro": { "en": "Lo, la, los and las replace a noun you have already mentioned." },
  "palabras": {
    "lo": { "en": "him, it (masculine)", "pron": "lo", "cat": "pronoun" },
    "la": { "en": "her, it (feminine)", "pron": "la", "cat": "pronoun" },
    "los": { "en": "them (masculine)", "pron": "los", "cat": "pronoun" },
    "las": { "en": "them (feminine)", "pron": "las", "cat": "pronoun" },
    "veo": { "en": "I see", "pron": "BE-o", "cat": "verb" },
    "compro": { "en": "I buy", "pron": "KOM-pro", "cat": "verb" },
    "el pan": { "en": "the bread", "pron": "el pan", "genero": "m" },
    "a": { "en": "personal a", "pron": "a", "cat": "preposition", "nota": "A person who is the object takes a: veo a Pablo." }
  },
  "bloques": [
    {
      "tipo": "explicacion",
      "titulo": "Replace the noun",
      "texto": "The pronoun goes **before** a conjugated verb and matches the noun.\n\n- el libro → **Lo** veo.\n- la casa → **La** veo.\n- los libros → **Los** compro.\n- las llaves → **Las** tengo.\n\nA person still takes **a** when the noun is there: veo **a** Pablo. Then: **lo** veo."
    },
    {
      "tipo": "dialogo",
      "titulo": "At the market",
      "frases": [
        {
          "quien": "Lucía",
          "es": "¿Compras el pan?",
          "en": "Are you buying the bread?",
          "analisis": [
            ["¿Compras", "you buy"],
            ["el pan", "object"]
          ]
        },
        {
          "quien": "Pablo",
          "es": "Sí, lo compro.",
          "en": "Yes, I'm buying it.",
          "analisis": [
            ["lo", "it (the bread)"],
            ["compro", "I buy"]
          ]
        },
        {
          "quien": "Lucía",
          "es": "Yo veo a Ana.",
          "en": "I see Ana.",
          "analisis": [
            ["veo", "I see"],
            ["a Ana", "person as object"]
          ]
        },
        {
          "quien": "Pablo",
          "es": "Las llaves las tengo yo.",
          "en": "The keys, I have them.",
          "nota": "The noun can stay, and the pronoun repeats it. Las agrees with llaves.",
          "analisis": [
            ["Las llaves", "the keys"],
            ["las", "them"],
            ["tengo", "I have"]
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tipo": "vocabulario",
      "palabras": ["lo", "la", "los", "las", "veo", "compro", "el pan"]
    },
    {
      "tipo": "huecos",
      "id": "a2-lo-pan",
      "pregunta": { "en": "Complete: yes, I buy it. (the bread)" },
      "frase": "Sí, ___ compro.",
      "audio": true,
      "opciones": {
        "lo": { "en": "El pan is masculine singular." },
        "la": { "en": "La would be a feminine noun." },
        "los": { "en": "Los is plural." }
      },
      "correcta": "lo"
    },
    {
      "tipo": "ordenar",
      "id": "a2-lo-veo",
      "frase": "Yo veo a Ana",
      "traduccion": { "en": "I see Ana." }
    }
  ]
